{"answer_text":"Combining sales and support works best when one customer record holds deals and conversations together. Tools that make that practical: [1]\n\n- **Northwind CRM Service Desk**: Its service module links tickets to accounts, at enterprise prices. [2]\n- **Tallyfox**: Not a help desk itself, but its shared-inbox add-on keeps support threads next to deal history. [3]\n- **Halcyon Sales**: Focused on selling, with only basic ticket handling. [4]\n- **Sheetly**: Not suited to support work. [1]\n\nIn short, Northwind CRM is the strongest fit for most teams; Tallyfox is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50f5-7654-a9a5-c5adcc6475bd","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:01.450Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["crm with support inbox","unified customer record small business"],"latency_ms":4890,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[145,158],[499,512]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[251,259],[550,558]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"self","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[367,380]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"neutral","sentim